{"last_link_id": 294, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["*   **`method`**：使用策略\n\n      *   **`vision_yarn`:** 最适合 4K+ 和非正方形图像。可自动修复拉伸和伪影。\n\n      *   **`yarn` / `ntk`:** 传统方法。使用yarn 和yarn_alt_scaling 进行手动控制。\n\n*   **`enable_dype`**： 切换动态（时间感知）算法。保持启用以获得最佳质量。\n\n*   **`dype_scale`**： 频率偏移的幅度。默认值：2.0。\n\n*   **`dype_exponent`**： 动态时间表的强度。\n\n      *  `2.0`:最适合  **4K。**\n\n      *   `1.0`:最适合 **2K。**\n\n      *   `0.5`:最适合 **~1.5K。**\n\n*   **`yarn_alt_scaling`**：（仅限传统yarn）在Anisotropic（更锐利、潜在拉伸）和Isotropic（更柔和、精确几何图形）之间切换。\n\n*   **`base_shift / max_shift`**： 高级噪音控制。默认值（0.5 / 1.15）针对 FLUX 进行了优化"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "DyPE设置说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [327.53863525390625, 402.6158447265625], "pos": [-1654.013916015625, 172.41226196289062], "id": 107, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [66, 111], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Chinese fairy in misty bamboo forest, ethereal beauty, flowing silk hanfu, delicate features, serene expression, soft cinematic lighting, by Studio Ghibli and Artgerm, highly detailed, 8k, best quality"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 293, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [330, 210], "pos": [-40.9945068359375, 155.61874389648438], "id": 45, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.47", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 7}, {"